A ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/type-system.td")} added to an existing untyped language after the fact - must accommodate existing idioms and codebases rather than designing types from scratch.

A type system **added to an existing untyped language** after the fact - must accommodate existing idioms and codebases rather than designing types from scratch.
